<title>USA: New England Investment sets special div.</title>
<headline>New England Investment sets special div.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New England Investment Companies LP said Tuesday that the board of its general partner set a special distribution of $0.08 per unit for the second quarter.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable August 15 to holders of record June 30.</p>
</text>
